SOLUTION 1 DIC_solution
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca_solution
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca   50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 3
END

USE solution 3
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_sel.txt
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -pH true
    -si Calcite
END
